# P1 255 (endless tail) with a loud, sustained saw: without a limit it would build up without end; the tank limiter
# ducks the input and trims the loop so the output stays below 0 dBFS.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 2
track fx2
input saw 110 0.95
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
gain 1
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below -0.1
